description	"Ninja Assassin

^2Weaponry:
- Kunai (knife)
-- ^5Cyan ^7Style Only
- Blinding Black Egg [Secondary Grenade]
- Throwing Stars

^8Attributes:
- Masterful Arcobatics [Stamina + Dexterity 3]

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]

The ninja made use of many tools, such as the kunai knife and throwing stars. Another tool they used was the the black egg, which in one form could temporarily, even permanently blind their opponent, halting all resistance for their getaway or to deliver the finishing blow."